                            <div class="w-8 h-[1px] bg-white/30"></div>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-3 leading-tight tracking-tight">
                            Public Relations</h3>
                        <p class="text-base md:text-xl font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-400 max-w-2xl">Coverage that
                            positions you as a credible voice in your field, not a company that only appears when it
                            pushes out a release. Includes: media relations and press outreach, launch PR, spokesperson
                            media training, award and speaking placements.</p>
                    </a>
                    <!-- Card 3 -->
